Just in case anybody from the dev team follows this group,
I have two small suggestions for the next version:

o	Xorns shouldn't get caught in bear traps.  In particular,
	players polymorphed into xorns should be able to phase
	right through them (just like walls).  This might apply
	to webs, too, although I think Xorns are strong enough
	to tear them up. 

o	Players who eat eggs that are "(laid by you)" should get
	the "You cannibal!  You'll regret this!" message and the
	aggravate monster intrinsic.  I mean, really.  Only a sicko
	would eat their own egg.  Not that I've ever tried it, of
	course.

	You might even want to take this one further, and have any
	polymorphed player that eats a corpse of his/her own kind
	be considered a cannibal.  Maybe even have polymorphed
	players be able to safely eat humans?  imho.

I spend too much time polymorphed.
Great game.


